Algorithm:
```
groups = []
remaining = all modules
while remaining:
    # grow a maximal prefix of remaining that imports cleanly
    cur = []
    for m in remaining (in order):
        trial = cur + [m]
        if compiles(trial): cur = trial
        else: record conflict info for m; (optionally try to detect which module in cur conflicts)
    groups.append(cur); remaining -= cur
```
